    "description": "Real-time streaming weather data from 14 meteorological stations operated by the National Observatory of Athens (NOA). The dataset includes temperature, humidity, wind speed, barometric pressure, and rainfall measurements collected every 10 minutes. It supports point anomaly detection (individual outliers) and subsequence anomaly detection (unusual patterns) using Matrix Profile algorithm, with spatial verification to distinguish device failures from extreme weather events.",
